The Prince Who Walked Away — how Siddhartha became the Buddha (story-led collage, ~65 s, 9:16)

Story: the traditional account of Siddhartha Gautama's life. Channa's and Siddhartha's lines are paraphrased from it, not exact quotes.
Art: stills generated with Higgsfield (Nano Banana Pro), backgrounds removed with Higgsfield; duotone applied in art/duotone.py.
Narration: ElevenLabs voice "George"; Channa: ElevenLabs "Bill"; Siddhartha: ElevenLabs "Eric" (eleven_multilingual_v2).
Sound effects: ElevenLabs Sound Effects (audio/sfx.py), incl. the paper set from thirty-one-years.
Music: original piano, strings and tanpura-like drone, synthesised in audio/score.py (no samples).
Fonts (SIL OFL 1.1 / Apache 2.0): Playfair Display, Figtree, Permanent Marker, Caveat, Courier Prime.
Animation: GSAP 3.15; built and rendered with HyperFrames 0.9.20 (motion blur on).
